{% comment %}
  InstaMom University — status badge driven by product tags.
  Renders "Now Shipping", "Pre-Order Now", "Coming Soon", or "Seasonal"
  based on the product's tags, matching the CSVs in ../..

  Owner, Aug 2026: "Instead of pre order now banners, let's make the banner read
  'Ships August 14th'." A concrete date beats "pre-order", which tells a shopper
  they'll wait without saying how long. Owner again on 13 Aug 2026, the eve of
  that date: change it to "now shipping". The date had done its job — once it
  arrives the useful thing to say is that the wait is over, not how long it was.
  So the hard-coded date is gone from here and from the shipping note, and
  neither can go stale again.

  The label still hangs off the `ships-aug-14` TAG, whose NAME is now historical
  — read it as "in the 14 August wave", i.e. shipping. Renaming it is a write to
  three live products (Welcome Week Starter, Warm Hug from Home, Room Refresh),
  not a theme edit, so it was left alone deliberately. The same tag drives
  snippets/instamom-shipping-note.liquid; the two must keep agreeing.

  The label comes from that tag, NOT from `pre-order`, so a pre-order product
  without a confirmed ship date still falls back to "Pre-Order Now" rather than
  claiming to ship. Same reasoning as the shipping note.

  Usage — inside a product card or product page, pass the product:
    {% render 'instamom-badge', product: card_product %}
    {% render 'instamom-badge', product: product %}

  Styling: .instamom-badge* in assets/instamom.css
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign label = ''
  assign modifier = ''
  if product.tags contains 'ships-aug-14'
    assign label = 'Now Shipping'
    assign modifier = 'preorder'
  elsif product.tags contains 'pre-order'
    assign label = 'Pre-Order Now'
    assign modifier = 'preorder'
  elsif product.tags contains 'coming-soon'
    assign label = 'Coming Soon'
    assign modifier = 'coming-soon'
  elsif product.tags contains 'seasonal'
    assign label = 'Seasonal'
    assign modifier = 'seasonal'
  endif
-%}

{%- if label != '' -%}
  <span class="instamom-badge instamom-badge--{{ modifier }}">{{ label }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
